 423  * Finding circ matrix (LAMBDA) from Incidence Matrix (K)
 424  Parameter LAMBDA(icirc,iedge) hydraulic circ matrix;
GAMS 24.1.3  r41464 Released Jul 26, 2013 WEX-WEI x86_64/MS Windows                                                                                                                                                                    03/05/17 01:09:02 Page 9
G e n e r a l   A l g e b r a i c   M o d e l i n g   S y s t e m
